% intermittent wheeze; then evolving physical disease: vague abdominal pain,
% anorexia, ~9 kg weight loss, amenorrhea, wasting, mild dehydration. Exam:
% BP 88/44, HR 116; skin darkening over elbows/knees/ankles + buccal mucosal
